  "description": "Find the length of the longest set S where S[i] = {A[i], A[A[i]], A[A[A[i]]], ...} following the array indices.",
  "target": null,
  "pseudocode": "let maxLen = 0;\nlet visited = new Array(nums.length).fill(false);\nfor (let i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {\n  if (!visited[i]) {\n    let curr = i, count = 0;\n    while (!visited[curr]) {\n      visited[curr] = true;\n      curr = nums[curr];\n      count++;\n    }\n    maxLen = Math.max(maxLen, count);\n  }\n}\nreturn maxLen;",
